WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:03,710
Mi'er, let's have a look.

2
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:06,740
Cannibals, bloodthirsty and brutal terrifying power flames

3
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:09,740
I love eating meat that tastes delicious. Don’t be caught by it.

4
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:11,740
Otherwise, you will be brutally eaten by them

5
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:13,740
Adult cannibal, a warrior attacks

6
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:16,740
A warrior strikes the final blow and contains a high-ranking Nupu class

7
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:19,740
Oh my god, is it so scary?

8
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:21,740
Senior, the strength of these three guys

9
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:24,740
Can easily defeat the black bear we encountered before

10
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:26,970
You have to be careful when going to the forest in the future.

11
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,970
It would be dangerous if this happens

12
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:30,970
You two siblings have to be careful.

13
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:33,970
You must know that our flesh and blood is rich in salt.

14
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:37,030
Very attractive to those beasts

15
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:40,030
There is a kind of man-eating bear called the Tibetan bear.

16
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:42,030
He will even pretend to be a human or an animal and wave to you

17
00:00:42,030 --> 00:00:44,030
I'll eat you when you get close

18
00:00:44,030 --> 00:00:47,030
And cannibals are far more terrifying than beasts

19
00:00:47,030 --> 00:00:50,640
Brothers and sisters, can you think of a way?

20
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:53,640
The wooden house cannot be moved. Sooner or later it will be discovered.

21
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:55,640
Don't panic, little sister

22
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:58,640
I have a bamboo forest here. I'll cut some bamboo for you.

23
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:00,640
You sharpen them and make them into traps.

24
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:02,640
I have some paralyzing grass branches here.

25
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:04,640
I can give you some in exchange for cheaper.

26
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:07,640
Big brother, can you come over tomorrow and help us make traps?

27
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:09,640
If we want revenge, we can give it an hour

28
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:11,640
Pay you four units of wood

29
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:14,640
There's nothing important to do tomorrow, just take two days to go there

30
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:15,640
What's more, there's wood

31
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:17,640
Good deal. Four units then.

32
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:19,640
We'll go find you early tomorrow morning
